  "description": "Thats What They All Say is the debut studio album by American rapper Jack Harlow. It was released on December 11, 2020, by Generation Now and Atlantic Records. The album features guest appearances from Lil Baby, Big Sean, Chris Brown, Adam Levine, EST Gee, Bryson Tiller, DaBaby, Tory Lanez and Lil Wayne, the latter three appear on the remix of Harlow's breakout single, \"Whats Poppin\". It also features a posthumous guest appearance from Static Major. At the \"63rd Annual Grammy Awards\", \"Whats Poppin\" was nominated for the \"Grammy Award for Best Rap Performance\".",
